Z||000020||Dan86gt3.8||05-11-2000||03:15 AM||||hell ya 3800's are awesome!  sory I don't have the suer charger phil, but lord knows it wasn't my dea to get a naturall aspirated one!  I had a govenor, and I am not talking about the 110 cuttoff I mean my dad!  but after I get out of school forced induction is coming.  And yes for the guy that was lucky enough to have a vette I did say most cause some vette owners realize it was meant to go fast so they do!<BR>I also believe ace has a good kit.  If you are a semi good mechanic you can do it yourself.  You might not do the welding yourself if you are not skilled in the art, but other than that its some simple drilling and wrenching.  He does all the electronics, all you have to do is bolt it in and hook up some wires.  Not much more than the famed 2.8-3.4 swap.  There are some guys that have done it themselves.  Anywho I love it and recomend it to everyone!||||reg||1
